      "heading": "Introduction to Machine Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Machine learning involves teaching computers to learn from data.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "It contrasts with giving computers explicit rules.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Supervised Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "System is trained on labeled data.",
          "timestamp": "00:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Example: Email marked as spam or not spam.",
          "timestamp": "00:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Model learns patterns to predict unseen cases.",
          "timestamp": "00:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "Common algorithms: Decision trees, Support Vector Machines, Neural Networks.",
          "timestamp": "00:40"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Unsupervised Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "System finds patterns without labels.",
          "timestamp": "00:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "Example: Clustering customers based on purchasing behavior.",
          "timestamp": "00:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "K-means is a classic algorithm.",
          "timestamp": "00:58"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reinforcement Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Agent interacts with an environment and learns from feedback or rewards.",
          "timestamp": "01:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Examples: Training AI to play video games or control a robot.",
          "timestamp": "01:10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Challenges in Machine Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Overfitting: Model memorizes training data, performs poorly on new data.",
          "timestamp": "01:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bias: Occurs when the data itself is not balanced.",
          "timestamp": "01:30"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Applications of Machine Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Healthcare: Disease prediction.",
          "timestamp": "01:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Finance: Fraud detection.",
          "timestamp": "01:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "Self-driving cars: Object recognition.",
          "timestamp": "01:50"
        }
      ]
    },
